  unitName: "Kyo Kusanagi (6\u2605)"
  unitId: 810186
  unitNumber: 8209
  description: A carefree fighter with the power to manipulate fire, Kyo was the
    first to receive a blood-scented invitation to an unheard-of tournament. Sensing
    the evil within the letter, he began his investigation into the so-called Scarlet
    Abyss Tournament. However, despite its grandiose name, there was something about
    it that tickled his curiosity. He chased clue after clue, but somehow never completed
    the full picture. It wasn't until he reached an abandoned army base deep in the
    heart of the wetlands that he found a pitch-black portal to another world, and
    a very familiar glove from a villain he thought he had defeated...
  summonDesc: New world, same rules.<br>There's always a bad guy to beat.
  fusionDesc: Is this it?<br>A little underwhelming, honestly.
